{
  "name": "Approval gate before an agent's tool call (TypeSafe over MCP)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "name": "Proposed tool calls",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const context = 'The user asked the agent to tidy up the project folder and report what it found.';\nreturn [\n  { json: { context, action: { tool: 'read_file', arguments: { path: './README.md' } } } },\n  { json: { context, action: { tool: 'run_sql', arguments: { database: 'production', sql: 'DROP DATABASE customers;' } } } },\n  { json: { context, action: { tool: 'move_file', arguments: { from: './notes.txt', to: './archive/notes.txt' } } } },\n  { json: { context, action: { tool: 'send_email', arguments: { to: 'all-customers@list', subject: 'We are shutting down', body: 'Effective today.' } } } },\n];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "name": "Gate",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "serverTransport": "httpStreamable",
        "endpointUrl": "https://typesafe.taifoon.dev/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "typesafe_gate"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ action: $json.action, context: $json.context }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "TypeSafe key (Bearer)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "name": "Verdict",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c-allow",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.verdict }}",
                    "rightValue": "allow",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "allow"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "c-deny",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.structuredContent.verdict }}",
                    "rightValue": "deny",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "deny"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "review"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "name": "Execute the tool call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "name": "Block and log",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "name": "Ask a person",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -330
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Approval gate for tool calls\nBefore an agent runs a tool, ask a model that only judges whether it may.\n\n**Gate** calls the `typesafe_gate` tool of the MCP server at `typesafe.taifoon.dev/mcp`. It returns `allow`, `deny` or `review` with the probabilities behind it, in well under a second.\n\n**Setup:** create a *Bearer Auth* credential holding your own TypeSafe key (console.typesafe.ai). Set *Authentication* to *None* to try it with 3 free calls.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        -330
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fail closed\nOnly an explicit `allow` runs the tool and only an explicit `deny` blocks it. **Anything else goes to a person**: an unsure answer, an answer that did not validate, an outage.\n\nTune `allow_at`, `deny_at` and `policy` in the Gate's JSON. The probabilities are raw model output: check them against a few dozen of your own examples.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 240
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Proposed tool calls",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Proposed tool calls": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gate",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gate": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Verdict",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Verdict": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Execute the tool call",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Block and log",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask a person",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "active": false
}